#+TITLE: Preserve native session restoration failure details
#+STATUS: DONE
#+PRIORITY: P1
#+TYPE: bug
#+BRANCH: codex/alfe-restore-error-detail

* Symptom
AutoCAD SCHME job 565739 passed all 23 tests but reported only FAILED session
restoration. The caught error object was discarded by PREPARE-SHUTDOWN.

* Resolution in 2.3.96
Record the restoration step before each native SETVAR, preserve the caught
message in protocol stderr and status, and include the last native status in
the CLI shutdown error. A failed restoration still cannot acknowledge RESTORED
or close the created application. Hosted-runtime failure injection and CLI
error propagation tests cover the diagnostic and retained failure policy.
Native qualification of the SCHME job remains separate from this diagnostic fix.
